  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy giá trị lớn nhất và giá trị nhỏ nhất của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></semantics></math> lần lượt là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m/s và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m/s.</li><li>Ta có đồ thị của hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math> như sau.\n\t\t\t<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Dựa vào đồ thị ta có trên các khoảng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></semantics></math> tăng.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/bb1c561b06f00bc395b77fdfad294fda6814db7e0a99d668f37003910719ac8a.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div></li></ol>",
